{
  "Notes": "Professor Dedlock (PFDD). *Contains Generated Dialog*",
  "Npcs": [
    "PFDD"
  ],
  "Openers": [
    {
      "Say": "1"
    }
  ],
  "Replies": {
    "i_have_something_to": {
      "Text": "I have something to give you.",
      "Goto": "2"
    }
  },
  "Lines": {
    "1": {
      "Text": "{delay 1}{emote}This person seems to have been studying you for a while before you entered conversation with him. A large badge on his chest reads: \"Professor Jo Dedlock, JAME\"{/emote}Yes, yes - you can help me, and I will give you a generous reward.\\nThat is what you want, right?\\nYes, fine - I assure you we will both greatly benefit from this... deal.",
      "Replies": [
        "i_have_something_to"
      ]
    },
    "2": {
      "Text": [
        "You have?! For me? Who would have thought...",
        "{delay 2}\\nLet's have a look.",
        "{opentrade}"
      ],
      "Replies": [
        "i_have_something_to"
      ]
    },
    "spec1": {
      "Text": [
        "{useitem 229611}",
        "The Mariner's Father! Yes... yes, this is exactly what I needed.",
        "{delay 2}\\n{emote}He leafs through the pages, then fixes you with a long stare. Something in your mind settles into a new shape.{/emote}",
        "{delay 2}\\nThere. Your first specialization. Bring me the next book when you find it."
      ],
      "Replies": [
        "i_have_something_to"
      ]
    },
    "spec2": {
      "Text": [
        "{useitem 229614}",
        "The Girl that Saw it All. You do find the most interesting things.",
        "{delay 2}\\n{emote}He reads a few lines aloud under his breath, and you feel the words take hold.{/emote}",
        "{delay 2}\\nYour second specialization. Keep looking - there is more to learn."
      ],
      "Replies": [
        "i_have_something_to"
      ]
    },
    "spec3": {
      "Text": [
        "{useitem 229612}",
        "Kanel's Story, complete! I had almost given up on seeing it whole.",
        "{delay 2}\\n{emote}He closes the book slowly. The room seems to tilt, then steady.{/emote}",
        "{delay 2}\\nYour third specialization. Only one book remains."
      ],
      "Replies": [
        "i_have_something_to"
      ]
    },
    "spec4": {
      "Text": [
        "{useitem 229613}",
        "Afirce's World Catalogue... every volume. Remarkable.",
        "{delay 2}\\n{emote}He clutches the catalogue to his chest and nods at you, almost respectfully.{/emote}",
        "{delay 2}\\nYour fourth and final specialization. Our deal is done - and I believe we have both benefited."
      ]
    },
    "refused": {
      "Text": "No, no - not this. I need the books in their proper order, and only the one you have not already brought me. Come back when you have it."
    }
  },
